:''Not to be confused with [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)]]''
'''Manga Boogie Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] who was implemented in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch Version]] of [[The Battle Cats]]. He originates from Manya Immortal Nosuke's "Manga! The Battle Cats" and was released as promotional material for the CoroCoro Magazine Monthly April 2024 Issue. Purchasing the issue comes with a special goodies box in which contains a trading card that has a serial code to unlock said unit. As of March 15, 2024, Manga Boogie Cat is ''<u>only</u>'' exclusive to the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') version.

