==Trivia==
*It, [[Manga Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Cat]], and [[Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat]] are based off main characters from The Battle Cats Manga made by Manya Immortal Nosuke (萬屋不死身之介先生) which is published under CoroCoro Comic.
*It, Manga Cat, Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat, and [[Nora (Special Cat)|Nora]] are currently the only units that originate from a manga.

